<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We would, O God, present before Thy face</l><l>The fragrant name of Thy beloved Son;</l><l>By faith we view Him through Thy boundless grace,</l><l>Which, by His dying, He for us has won.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Thy joy in Him who is with Thee we share;</l><l>Our hearts delight in Thy delight in Him;</l><l>Chiefest of thousands, fairer than the fair;</l><l>His glory nought can tarnish, nought can dim.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>We bow in worship now before Thy throne,</l><l>By faith the Object of Thy love would see;</l><l>Who, in the midst, His brethren’s song doth lead.</l><l>To Him, our Savior, shall the glory be!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
